# Generated platform folders (run `flutter create .` to regenerate)
# android/ is deliberately NOT excluded, unlike the others: unlike macOS's
# small entitlements/Info.plist tweaks, Android support requires real
# hand-written native code (AiControlAccessibilityService.kt,
# MainActivity.kt's MethodChannel wiring) that `flutter create` doesn't
# regenerate and that would otherwise have to be reapplied by hand after
# every fresh scaffold. See README's Android setup section.
/ios/
/linux/
/macos/
/windows/
/web/

